  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "<align=center><b>Muut</b></align>\n\nKosteikoilla el\xE4\xE4 my\xF6s kaikenlaisia
      muita hy\xF6nteisi\xE4 ja nilvi\xE4isi\xE4. Kosteikoilla esiintyy monenlaisia
      kuoriaisia, juotikkaita, perhosia, simpukoita, kotiloita ja h\xE4m\xE4h\xE4kkej\xE4."
    sw: "<align=center><b>\xD6vriga</b></align>\nV\xE5tmarker \xE4r ocks\xE5 hem
      f\xF6r alla m\xF6jliga andra insekter och bl\xF6tdjur. I v\xE5tmarker f\xF6rekommer
      m\xE5nga olika skalbaggar, iglar, fj\xE4rilar, musslor, sn\xE4ckor och spindlar."
    en: '<align=center><b>Others</b></align>

      Wetlands are also home to all
      kinds of other insects and mollusks. Wetlands host many types of beetles, leeches,
      butterflies, mussels, snails, and spiders.'
